# Moderator Guide

Welcome, mod. You have the power to delete any jewel. Use it wisely.

## What you can do
* Post, edit, and delete your own jewels (like any user).
* Delete anyone's jewel if it breaks the rules.

## What you can't do
* Edit someone else's jewel. Their words are their own.

## Guidelines
* Remove spam, hate, and anything that isn't a shower thought.
* When in doubt, leave it up.

